  - html-to-text
  - beautifulsoup
  - llm
abstract: >-
  Python script that downloads one web page and writes its human-readable text into a UTF-8 text
  file, for offline reading, search, a text corpus or a large language model. It removes the
  scripts and style sheets, decodes the HTML entities and reduces line breaks and runs of blanks to
  single spaces, names the output file after the address when no name is given, and reports
  network and file errors in one line with a non-zero exit status.
